Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Monica Fallon work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 81, "text": "**Renowned Researcher Monica Fallon Leaves Lasting Legacy at Cardiff University**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 83, "end": 147, "text": "Cardiff, UK - The academic community is mourning the loss of Dr."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 148, "end": 281, "text": "Monica Fallon, a trailblazing researcher who spent over a decade at Cardiff University, leaving an indelible mark on the institution."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 282, "end": 444, "text": "Fallon's groundbreaking work in her field has inspired a new generation of scholars, and her contributions to the university will be remembered for years to come."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 445, "end": 616, "text": "During her tenure at Cardiff University, Fallon was a driving force behind several high-profile research projects, including a landmark study on climate change mitigation."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 617, "end": 757, "text": "Her team's findings, published in the prestigious journal Nature, shed new light on the role of carbon capture in reducing global emissions."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 758, "end": 808, "text": "\"Monica was a true pioneer in her field,\" said Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 809, "end": 860, "text": "Rachel Jenkins, a colleague and friend of Fallon's."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 861, "end": 968, "text": "\"Her passion and dedication to her work were contagious, and she inspired us all to strive for excellence.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 969, "end": 1104, "text": "Fallon's impact extended beyond the academic sphere, as her research had real-world implications for policymakers and industry leaders."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1105, "end": 1286, "text": "Her work with the Welsh government helped inform environmental policy, and her collaborations with private companies led to the development of innovative, eco-friendly technologies."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1287, "end": 1463, "text": "\"Monica was a brilliant scientist, but she was also an exceptional communicator,\" said Professor Mark Evans, Dean of the School of Environmental Sciences at Cardiff University."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1464, "end": 1590, "text": "\"She had a unique ability to distill complex ideas into actionable solutions, making her a valuable asset to our institution.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1591, "end": 1690, "text": "Fallon's legacy is also reflected in the numerous awards and honors she received during her career."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1691, "end": 1856, "text": "She was a recipient of the prestigious Royal Society Wolfson Research Merit Award and was named one of the UK's top 100 most influential women in science by the BBC."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1857, "end": 2060, "text": "According to data from Cardiff University, Fallon's research group attracted over £5 million in funding during her tenure, supporting the work of dozens of graduate students and postdoctoral researchers."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2061, "end": 2165, "text": "\"Monica's passing is a tremendous loss, but her work will continue to inspire and motivate us,\" said Dr."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2166, "end": 2174, "text": "Jenkins."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2175, "end": 2317, "text": "\"Her legacy will live on through the countless lives she touched and the meaningful contributions she made to our understanding of the world.\""}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2318, "end": 2399, "text": "Fallon is survived by her husband, John, and their two children, Emily and James."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2400, "end": 2523, "text": "A memorial service will be held at Cardiff University's Main Building on March 15th to celebrate her life and achievements."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 71, "text": "Title: The Barcelona Connection: Unraveling the Career of Monica Fallon"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 73, "end": 204, "text": "In the vibrant city of Barcelona, where the Mediterranean Sea meets the Pyrenees Mountains, a hub of scientific innovation thrives."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 205, "end": 423, "text": "The Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona, a prestigious CSIC (Spanish National Research Council) institution, has been at the forefront of groundbreaking discoveries, pushing the boundaries of human knowledge."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 424, "end": 585, "text": "It is here that our story begins, with a talented researcher named Monica Fallon, whose professional journey is inextricably linked to this esteemed institution."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 586, "end": 612, "text": "Chapter 1: The Early Years"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 614, "end": 735, "text": "Monica Fallon's fascination with the intricacies of human biology began during her undergraduate studies in biochemistry."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 736, "end": 816, "text": "Her academic prowess and innate curiosity earned her a coveted spot in the Ph.D."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 817, "end": 856, "text": "program at the University of Barcelona."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 857, "end": 1014, "text": "As she delved deeper into the world of biomedical research, Monica's passion for understanding the complexities of human health and disease only intensified."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1015, "end": 1047, "text": "Chapter 2: The Institute Beckons"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1049, "end": 1206, "text": "In 2005, Monica's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she joined the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona as a postdoctoral researcher."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1207, "end": 1386, "text": "This move marked the beginning of a fruitful collaboration with the institute's esteemed scientists, who were renowned for their pioneering work in molecular biology and genetics."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1387, "end": 1567, "text": "Monica's arrival at the institute coincided with a period of rapid growth and expansion, as the institution was poised to become a leading center for biomedical research in Europe."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1568, "end": 1601, "text": "Chapter 3: A Researcher's Odyssey"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1603, "end": 1678, "text": "During her tenure at the institute, Monica worked under the guidance of Dr."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1679, "end": 1751, "text": "Maria Rodríguez, a distinguished expert in the field of cancer genetics."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1752, "end": 1892, "text": "Together, they embarked on a series of projects aimed at elucidating the molecular mechanisms underlying cancer development and progression."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1893, "end": 2035, "text": "Monica's contributions to these studies were instrumental in shedding light on the critical role of epigenetic modifications in tumorigenesis."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2036, "end": 2206, "text": "Her research was met with acclaim, earning her several publications in prestigious scientific journals, including the Journal of Biological Chemistry and Cancer Research."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2207, "end": 2250, "text": "Chapter 4: Collaborations and Breakthroughs"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2252, "end": 2410, "text": "Monica's work at the institute was characterized by a spirit of collaboration, as she worked closely with colleagues from diverse backgrounds and disciplines."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2411, "end": 2443, "text": "One such collaboration, with Dr."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2444, "end": 2590, "text": "Juan Carlos Izpisúa Belmonte, a pioneer in the field of regenerative medicine, led to a groundbreaking discovery in the area of stem cell biology."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Cardiff University", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Monica Fallon", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Monica Fallon spent over a decade at Cardiff University.", "answer": "Cardiff University", "quote": "Monica Fallon, a trailblazing researcher who spent over a decade at Cardiff University, leaving an indelible mark on the institution.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Monica Fallon", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Monica Fallon joined the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona as a postdoctoral researcher in 2005.", "answer": "Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona", "quote": "In 2005, Monica's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she joined the Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona as a postdoctoral researcher.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Cardiff University", "Institute of Biomedical Research of Barcelona"]}

